{
  "id": "universal-jc-upsmash",
  "name": "Jump-cancel up smash",
  "part": "tech",
  "characters": "all",
  "goal": "An up smash out of a dash",
  "why": "A dash cannot be turned into an up smash directly. Jumping first and pushing the C-stick up during jump squat gives an up smash that slides with the dash's speed, so {char} can run in and up smash at once.",
  "tutorial": {
    "camera": {
      "follow": "player",
      "distance": 120,
      "height": 10
    },
    "what": "A jump-cancelled up smash is an up smash input during jump squat. It turns the jump into an up smash on the ground.",
    "expect": "Each jump is judged when the jump squat ends: whether {char} went into an up smash during it, and how many frames after the jump. After misses, the coach shows your jump and C-stick against the {J}-frame jump squat.",
    "example": [
      {
        "stick": [
          1,
          0
        ],
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 6
      },
      {
        "press": "jump",
        "frame": 6,
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "cstick": [
          0,
          1
        ],
        "frame": 7
      }
    ],
    "marks": {
      "1": "Frame 1: control stick forward: dash",
      "6": "Frame 6: jump pressed. Jump squat begins",
      "7": "Frame 7: C-stick up in jump squat: up smash, still sliding"
    },
    "lessons": [
      {
        "title": "An up smash during jump squat",
        "text": [
          "On every frame of jump squat after the first, the game checks for an up smash before it lets {char} leave the ground: A with the control stick up, or the C-stick pushed up. Either cancels the jump squat into an up smash on the ground.",
          "Jump squat is {J} frames, counting the jump's press as frame 1. The C-stick on frames 2 to {J} gives the up smash. On frame {J+1} {char} is in the air and the C-stick gives an up air."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "cstick": [
                  0,
                  1
                ],
                "frame": 2
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "1": "Frame 1: jump pressed. Jump squat begins",
              "2": "Frame 2: C-stick up in jump squat: up smash"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  1,
                  1
                ],
                "words": "Jump squat",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  2,
                  "J"
                ],
                "words": "C-stick up now: up smash",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+1",
                  "J+1"
                ],
                "words": "C-stick up here: up air",
                "kind": "late"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "characters": "jump_squat"
      },
      {
        "title": "Out of a dash",
        "text": [
          "During a dash, the C-stick up does nothing and A gives a dash attack: there is no up smash from a dash. A jump cancels the dash into jump squat, and the up smash is allowed there, while {char} keeps sliding with the dash's speed.",
          "So the order is: dash, jump, then the C-stick up 1 to {J-1} frames after the jump. Pushed on the same frame as the jump, the C-stick is read in the dash and does nothing."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "stick": [
                  1,
                  0
                ],
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 6
              },
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 6,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "cstick": [
                  0,
                  1
                ],
                "frame": 7
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "1": "Frame 1: control stick forward: dash",
              "6": "Frame 6: jump pressed. Jump squat begins",
              "7": "Frame 7: C-stick up in jump squat: up smash, still sliding"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  1,
                  5
                ],
                "words": "Dash",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  6,
                  6
                ],
                "words": "Jump",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  7,
                  "J+5"
                ],
                "words": "C-stick up now: up smash",
                "kind": "go"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
